21502      /* STAT-SURVEYLOGISTIC-022: SURVEYLOGISTIC — Existence of Maximum Likelihood Estimates
21503       * Source: S154 / Chapter 120 / `Existence of Maximum Likelihood Estimates` (PDF pp. 9847–9848).
21504       * Discriminates: Verified default procedure context
21505       */
21506      options nosyntaxcheck obs=max firstobs=1 nodate nonumber nocenter linesize=160 pagesize=max nostimer nofullstimer validvarname=v7
21506    ! validmemname=compatible locale=en_US;
21507      %let syscc=0;
21508      title; footnote;
21509      ods _all_ close;
21510      ods listing gpath="%sysfunc(pathname(work))";
21511      ods graphics off;
21512      proc datasets library=work kill nolist;
NOTE: Deleting WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
NOTE: File WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
NOTE: Deleting WORK.SASGOPT (memtype=CATALOG).
NOTE: File WORK.SASGOPT (memtype=CATALOG) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
NOTE: Deleting WORK.SURVEY (memtype=DATA).
NOTE: Deleting WORK.TEMPLAT (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
NOTE: File WORK.TEMPLAT (memtype=ITEMSTOR) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
21512    !                                         quit;


21513      ods path work.templat(update) sashelp.tmplmst(read);
21514      
21515      data survey;
21516      call streaminit(722);
21517      do stratum=1 to 2;
21518      do cluster=1 to 4;
21519      do id=1 to 12;
21520      age=20+mod(id*7+cluster,45);
21521      event=rand('bernoulli',0.3);
21522      weight=2+stratum+cluster/10;
21523      output;
21524      end;
21525      end;
21526      end;
21527      run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.SURVEY has 96 observations and 6 variables.

21528      proc surveylogistic data=survey;
21529      strata stratum;
21530      cluster cluster;
21531      weight weight;
21532      model event(event='1')=age;
21533      run;

NOTE: PROC SURVEYLOGISTIC is modeling the probability that event=1.
NOTE: Convergence criterion (GCONV=1E-8) satisfied.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE SURVEYLOGISTIC printed page 1426.

